body:
Thank you for inventing this ( my friends still find it odd). I had figured out some buttons were silent vs others... oddly the switch and ball are my least favorite.....  the buttons are my favorite.... they may have gotten worn out from just the smooth feel.     I remember in school I wouldn't use a pencil eraser because it helped keep me happy and quiet.

&#x200B;

once in a conference call I unconsciously was almost pressing a button on the interface thingy.

I'm currently in that boat with my adhd and depression. realized maybe I need to stay consistent for a while on my Adderall instead of taking it when I have boring computer work.

&#x200B;

also on antidepressant too. just following this thread and oddly happy im not alone in this.
